{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"茎"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"茎"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p><strong>茎</strong> (stalk) 是"},{"Local":{"url":"意象的点","text":"意象的点"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"逆像","text":"逆像"}},{"Plain":"函子.</p>\n<p>茎的元素称为<strong>芽</strong> (germ).</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>丛的截面</h3>\n<p>对于"},{"Local":{"url":"纤维丛","text":"纤维丛"}},{"Plain":" $p\\colon E\\to B$, 点 $b\\in B$ 处的一个<strong>截面芽</strong> (germ of sections) 是 $(U,s)$ 的等价类, 其中 $U$ 是 $b$ 的邻域, $s$ 是 $p$ 在 $U$ 上的截面. "},{"Local":{"url":"等价关系","text":"等价关系"}},{"Plain":"是对于更小的邻域 $V\\subset U$, $(U,s)\\sim (V,s|_V)$. 这就是说截面芽的集合为"},{"Local":{"url":"余极限","text":"余极限"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{colim}_U \\Gamma(U,p).\r\n$$\n注意这是一个"},{"Local":{"url":"滤余极限","text":"滤余极限"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}